;
; How Warble files a track in its library index, in MYRA: the track's
; place in the library, its length in ms and when its file last changed
; (Unix seconds). The digits hold more than track.eve's ranges allow, so a
; track past them is held.
^ZXWARBLE(track:i4) = ms:i8! ^ mtime:i11!
